{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/e6cd2824f01cefab300ae4649bdbf4b1.avif?t=1768510359\" width=1516 height=858 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the mysterious disappearance of the previous cashier at local joint, Neighborhood Video, you are contracted as an amateur private investigator to case the store while undercover. In between stocking shelves and mopping floors, follow clues left behind by the missing employee by completing escape room puzzles and perusing the film database. Translate ciphers, combine objects, and hunt for hidden messages to uncover a blockbuster conspiracy. Between employees vanishing without a trace, the impending threat of rival video stores, and hints at cult activity, find more than you bargained for - all for minimum wage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/03ba53d1ddaa7840e3aa610eb0594f4a.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To maintain your cover and please the manager, return outstanding tapes each night by brainstorming through 3D point and click escape room style puzzles. Clean the store, inspect aisles from top to bottom, and cleverly utilize items to successfully close up shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/61c6a90e45ba47dca5c11ce8dd3ad04e.poster.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/61c6a90e45ba47dca5c11ce8dd3ad04e.webm?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/61c6a90e45ba47dca5c11ce8dd3ad04e.mp4?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/accf74b8b8e753712aa3e8e145583e1c.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deduce puzzle solutions by browsing the Neighborhood Video Film Database. Read private emails, delve into customer rental history, and eyeball the booming collection of (fake) film classics to progress through cryptic clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/bdb05060d06629faf9645cae26a895f1.poster.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/bdb05060d06629faf9645cae26a895f1.webm?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/bdb05060d06629faf9645cae26a895f1.mp4?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/ce423cbe4ff1e73b09d2148282886006.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the cashier\u2019s disappearance by interpreting the hidden breadcrumb trail left between the tapes. Uncover hidden messages that illustrate what appears to be a simple missing persons job may be a larger conspiracy in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/b2712131610fa9267eb8ca1e5a6dcb38.poster.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/b2712131610fa9267eb8ca1e5a6dcb38.webm?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/b2712131610fa9267eb8ca1e5a6dcb38.mp4?t=1768510359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/extras/28de1cfb8650217507a308420ca713e0.avif?t=1768510359\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Point and Click puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cipher translation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult activity brewing conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s pastiche searchable PC database</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS shelves showcasing 50+ serviceable film cover parodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highbrow Cow store mascot, Seymour Moovies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-futurism sentiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your very own name tag!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072630?t=1768510359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/1f09f1973dcaa2578ed90a1257701446faddc3b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768510359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072630/2201d174527097114f504c08851a35782a026433/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768510359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_